        <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:#2a3c54;line-height:1.73;margin:0 0 14px">Replacing the ice maker assembly before ruling out temperature, water supply, and control issues is how customers end up with a new assembly in a refrigerator that still does not make ice. Diagnosis comes before parts.</p>
        <p style="font-size:0.83rem;color:#6a7a8e;line-height:1.65;padding:12px 16px;background:#f0f2f7;border:1px solid rgba(30,50,80,0.07);border-radius:10px;margin:0">Repair notes on this page are based on this specific RF28R7351SG service call. The same symptom on another unit may have a different cause and should be diagnosed before any part is replaced.</p>
